title: Psalms 31–32: Into Thine Hand, and the Blessedness of Forgiveness
description: Psalms 31-32 in the King James Bible: into thine hand I commit my spirit, the God of truth and false prophets, my times are in thy hand, blessed is he whose transgression is forgiven, transgression, sin and iniquity, and the atonement of Leviticus 16 fulfilled in Christ, from the Psalms series studies.
output: lessons/bible/psalms-31-32.html
context: yes

